<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-WORLD TEAM CUP FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WORLD TEAM CUP FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the final of the World Team Cup on Sunday:</p>
<p>Spain lead Australia 1-0 (Spanish names first) Felix Mantilla beat Mark Woodforde 7-5 6-2</p>
</text>
